:: Garden Stem Help
<<effects>>
<<speechresolve>>

<<if _speechAttitudeResolved is "shy">>
	You pull against the shoots around your arms and legs, but they keep you pinned. "H-help!" you call.
<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "meek" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "docile")>>
	You stop pulling long enough to shout, "Please, someone help me!"
<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "polite" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "flamboyant")>>
	You twist onto your side and call towards the orphanage. "Help! I'm stuck over here!"
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "confident">>
	You plant one foot against the ground and pull at the shoot around your arm. "Someone get over here and help me!"
<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "bratty" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "cruel")>>
	You yank at the shoots around your limbs. "Get this bloody thing off me!" you shout.
<<else>>
	You pull against the shoots wrapped around you. "Help! Someone help me!"
<</if>>

<<if Time.dayState is "night">>
	<<generate1>><<person1>>
	No one answers. You pull again, but the shoots keep your limbs pinned. Then the garden fence creaks. Someone drops down on the other side and walks towards you.
	<br><br>

	"Well now," says a <<personssimple>> voice. "One of the orphans got <<pherself stranger>> all tangled." A <<person>> crouches in front of you and looks at the shoots around your arms and legs. "Not allowed in the orphanage they says, but you're not in the orphanage, are you?" <<He>> tears several shoots away from your body, leaving the ones around your limbs in place. Then <<he>> climbs on top of you.
	<br><br>

	<<link [[Next|Garden Stem Rape]]>><<set $molestationstart to 1>><</link>>
	<br>
<<else>>
	<<run statusCheck("Robin")>>
	<<if $rng gte 51 and _robin_location is "orphanage" and C.npc.Robin.trauma lt 80 and $daily.robin.tending isnot 1>>
		<<npc Robin>><<person1>>
		"I'm coming!" shouts a voice in response. It's Robin. <<He>> emerges from the orphanage and gasps when <<he>> sees you. "You're all tangled. Here." <<He>> drops to <<his>> knees and loosens the entwined shoots. <<Hes>> careful not to damage any of them.
		<br><br>

		<<He>> works <<his>> fingers beneath the shoots one at a time, lifting them away from your arms and legs without tearing the plants. Once your hands are free, you help push the remaining growth aside and crawl clear.
		<br><br>

		"It's a good thing you didn't fall into stinging nettles," <<he>> says as <<he>> brushes soil from <<his>> knees. "I try to keep the garden free of them, but they keep coming back."
		<br><br>
		You thank Robin, and <<he>> heads back towards the orphanage proper.
		<br><br>

		<<link [[Next|Garden Flowers]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
		<br>
	<<else>>
		<<generatey1>><<person1>>
		You hear footsteps. "Don't worry," says a <<person>> as <<he>> crouches beside you. "They don't have thorns." <<He>> pulls apart the shoots restraining you, frowning at the effort. "These are really tight. It's almost like they have a life of their own."
		<br><br>

		You push against the loosened shoots while <<he>> pulls from the other side. After several tries, enough space opens for you to drag one leg free, then the other. You get to your feet and thank <<him>>. <<He>> returns to the orphanage proper.
		<br><br>

		<<link [[Next|Garden Flowers]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
		<br>
