<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "polite" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "flamboyant")>>
	You move between <<him>> and the plot. "I understand you're struggling, but you can't take what I grew without asking."
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "confident">>
	You step between <<him>> and the crops. "Those are mine. You're not taking them."
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "bratty">>
