	You slap <<his>> hand away. "Not a chance. Get lost."
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "cruel">>
	You seize <<his>> wrist and push <<his>> hand back towards <<him>>. "Touch me again and you'll lose the hand."
<<else>>
	You move <<his>> hand off your arm. "No. That's not happening."
<</if>>
<br><br>

